Bind Npc 19005 Zone 21

On topics
    Topic "Keep talking" goto fortune

On fortune
    If player gold >= 10000
        Say "Okay, great. Shall we begin?"
        Topic "Give 10,000 Noah" do
            Transaction
                Take 10000 coins
                Open fortune panel
        Topic "Back" goto close
    Else
        Say "Yeah, well, we could start, but you don't seem to have the 10,000 Noah..."
        Topic "Back" goto close
